0..74 Comment "// A rule that reads an introduced cell\'s value on the face it is fixed on"
75..152 Comment "// violates the boundary its `ext` member generates: the boundary law and the"
153..231 Comment "// rule rewrite one term to `zero()` and to a variable, no rule the path order"
232..301 Comment "// orients joins them, and the block\'s rules are refused by name. The"
302..378 Comment "// extension type of `../../model/extension/generated.gandr` reads `zero` at"
379..405 Comment "// the face of every cell."
